<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW PLANS TO ISSUE NEW SHARES.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW PLANS TO ISSUE NEW SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish meat processing firm Sokolow SA plans a new share issue of between 2.75 and 5.5 million shares ex-rights, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the management's proposal would be voted on the company's shareholders meeting on June 25.</p>
<p>Sokolow currently has 27.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
